  "title": "Pineapple Bread Souffle",
  "description": "Utterly simple, this down-home bread pudding-like of butter, sugar, eggs, white bread cubes, and crushed pineapple is irresistible as either a dessert or side dish. That long-lasting, favorite white bread is recommended as the best bread of choice.",
